title: Guangxi Civil War
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: week_actions += 1; guangxicivilwar_timer += 3;
card-image: img/portraits/LuRongting.jpg
tags: warlord_affairs
view-if: gcw_timer = 0 and gcw_over = 0

= Guangxi Civil War

Guangxi has split between several factions after Chen Jiongming's invasion. Our favoured faction is Li Zongren, Bai Chongxi, and Huang Shaohong's clique, also known as the "New Guangxi Clique". Other factions include Shen Hongying, a Zhili-favored warlord and Lu Rongting, the Old Guangxi Clique Leader.

- @support: Supply Li Zongren's armies.
- @aid: Give monetary aid to Li Zongren's clique.
- @raid: Begin raids along the Guangxi border instead.

@support
subtitle: -2 resources.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; gxc_relation += 10;

Li Zongren's soldiers recieve more weapons.

@aid
subtitle: -1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; gxc_relation += 5;

Li Zongren's clique has recieved aid from us, which helps in their fight.

@raid
subtitle: +1 resource - Why would we do this?
on-arrival: resources += 1; gxc_relation -= 5;

We raided Guangxi border regions instead. This choice is questionable.
